# ViTacSim portable pack — path include list (relative to ViTacLab repo root)
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines ignored.
# Use bash_command/vitacsim_pack.sh to build the archive.

# --- Package / install ---
source/ViTacLab/setup.py
source/ViTacLab/pyproject.toml
source/ViTacLab/config/extension.toml

# --- Core ViTacSim sensor (TacSL VisuoTactile V1 + V2) ---
